<h2 class="single-post-title product_title entry-title" itemprop="name">NU1X</h2>
<div class="woocommerce-product-details__short-description">
	<p class="uk-margin uk-text-center uk-h3 uk-heading-line animate-elem slide-left in-view">It starts with a true acoustic action. More than <span class="surrana">5,000</span> genuine parts, meticulously crafted to deliver the unmistakable touch of a Yamaha acoustic piano. Our groundbreaking innovations recreate the sound and feel of two legendary concert grand pianos, from the natural vibrations of the strings to the subtle harmonics and rich overtones. All with the power, colors and shadings for the most demanding repertoire. The more you play AvantGrand, the more you realize it’s not just a revolution in digital pianos. It’s a revolution in the piano.</p>
